                  "speaker": "Ren",
                  "text": "..."
                },
                {
                  "speaker": "Ren",
                  "text": "You idiot. You stupid, stubborn idiot."
                },
                {
                  "speaker": "Ren",
                  "text": "...I'm here, Voss. I came."
                },
                {
                  "speaker": "Ren",
                  "text": "You can report to the Guild. I'm going to stay here for a while."
